+# Contract: area promotions, template of a new promotion in a newer module version
+
+## Source
+
+area: promotion template
+
+## Scope
+
+- The template of a new promotion lists the stores it applies to, empty until stores are chosen.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- Saving the promotion: covered by the existing promotion specs.
+
+## Cases
+
+| Case | Technique | Project | Data role | Oracle |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| C1 the promotion template has an empty list of stores | equivalence partitioning | restapi | store administrator | schema: GET the new-promotion template returns a promotion whose storeIds is an empty list |
+
+## Stand needs
+
+- Profile: the evaluation stand
+- Modules and flags: VirtoCommerce.Marketing 99.0.0 or later; the evaluation stand has an older version, so the case cannot run there yet
+- Data roles: store administrator
+
+## Building blocks
+
+- Reuse: `api.rest.promotions.template`
+- Add: one spec under `tests/restapi/marketing/`
+
+## Known issues
+
+- None
+
+## Verification
+
+- `npm run typecheck`, `npm run check`, then `npm run test:restapi -- tests/restapi/marketing/<new spec>`
